-of-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","content_id":"e4f33898-53fd-4329-94a7-796ae424ba5b","details":{"body":"<ul>\n  <li>Local government finance (including local taxation, business rates and local government pensions) </li>\n  <li>Local government policy (including stewardship, local audit, and governance reform) </li>\n  <li>Local government reorganisation </li>\n  <li>Homelessness and rough sleeping </li>\n  <li>Supported housing and domestic abuse </li>\n  <li>Resettlement </li>\n  <li>Planning casework</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-09-15T09:36:24Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Local Government and Homelessness)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/regional-and-local-government/local-government-councils-elections","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/regional-and-local-government/local-government-councils-elections","base_path":"/regional-and-local-government/local-government-councils-elections","content_id":"eca6eef8-4529-47db-8ba9-daa6305f15d3","details":{"internal_name":"Councils and elections [T]","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/regional-and-local-government/local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/regional-and-local-government/local-government","base_path":"/regional-and-local-government/local-government","content_id":"c914fd40-dd0a-45c4-a6ff-bce0cda31bde","details":{"internal_name":"Local government (merged, Level 2)","not